{
  "_note": "P2 -> P3 handshake. P3 builds their entire execution loop against this file from D3, six days before P2's generator works. task_stubs were added by P3 per docs/decisions/0003-taskstub-contract.md and are SIGNED OFF by P2 as of 0005 -- the shape is right and P2 will emit it unchanged. What is NOT right is the keying: tc_001..tc_005 name element ids (Task_autopay, Gateway_amount, Task_approval) that exist only in artifact.bpmn, and P2's testgen never sees an artifact. They are hand-written fixtures, correct as such, but they are not the shape P2 emits at D8. tc_006 is: asset_ref-keyed stubs, no element id anywhere. Build the resolver against tc_006, not against tc_001. See docs/decisions/0005 and 0009.",
